      "id": "vashka-showdown",
      "kind": "conflict",
      "title": "Vashka Cole's Spring",
      "prose": "Beyond the guardians, a hidden spring glimmers in a cavern lit by shafts of sun. Vashka Cole, captain of the Salt Hand Riders, stands over it with blade drawn and captives bound at her feet.",
