      "id": "ending-hero",
      "kind": "ending",
      "title": "Water for Duskwell",
      "prose": "You lead a caravan of relief back to Duskwell Waystation, the hidden spring's water sloshing in every cask. The well fills. The Trace, for the first time in memory, has given someone back.",
      "art": "art-the-bonewind-trace-ending-hero-caravan",
